# REQUIREMENTS: cu-009

Make the hypothesis-engine ledger portable: stop shipping a stale binary in git, and make a fresh checkout create its own ledger.db at build time. Fold into feat-18 as its final corrective CU. Untrack and ignore the runtime db (plus SQLite sidecars), add sqlite-jdbc to the sbt META-BUILD so build code can use it, and add an `ensureLedger` task that creates ledger.db from the embedded schemaDdl when absent and runs on compile. The project-level `libraryDependencies` in hypothesis-engine/build.sbt is NOT on the sbt build-definition classpath, so a task in build.sbt cannot load the driver until it is also declared in hypothesis-engine/project/plugins.sbt. Within build.sbt, do not alter the existing cleanLedger task body or the schemaDdl string; add only the new key, task and compile hook.
